"The keys you encrypt to and check signatures with. A key is trusted once you "
"have vouched for it; check its fingerprint with its owner first."
msgstr ""
"Las claves que utilizas para cifrar y comprobar firmas. Una clave pasa a ser "
"fiable cuando respondes por ella; comprueba primero su huella con su "
"propietario."

